# Generated protobuf/Connect code (gen/, web/src/gen/) is committed, like
# pkg/crds/*'s generated CRD bindings elsewhere in this repo - regenerate
# both with `make gen` after editing proto/. Only build *output* (installed
# deps, bundled JS, local databases) is ignored here.
/web/node_modules/
/web/dist/
/internal/webui/dist/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
